==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Doge Base (Enemy Base)|Doge Base]].
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 46.67 seconds<sup>1,400f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 70 seconds<sup>2,100f</sup>.
*1 [[Mr. Puffington]] spawns after 90 seconds<sup>2,700f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Try to sync up the Puffingtons so that you can use a strong unit to nuke them all. Send out a meatshield to tank a Doge Base hit, then use [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:N2]] to nuke the Puffington. The next three Puffingtons spawn quickly: once they're all on screen, use meatshields and an LD attacker like [[Rugby Cat (Rare Cat)|Quarterback Cat]] or [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] to sync them all up. Then use another Idi and kill them all. If you mess the Idi timing up, slowly chip the Puffingtons down using units like [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Jelly Dumpling Cat]], [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]], and [[Masked Yulala (Special Cat)|Spiritual Yulala]].

Alternatively, you can spam [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] and shred this whole stage. Royal Guard's fast attacks allow him to juggle Puffington, and Royal Guard has Wave Immunity.

If you don't own these units, [[Metal Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Metal Cat]] and any attacker that outranges Puffington's omnistrike (with a Wave Blocker if they don't have wave immunity) can be used to trivialise this stage completely. Just use Metal Cats to tank Puffington and win.

